{"3639060": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "DELIVERY MUST COMPLETE", "steam_appid": 3639060, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DELIVERY MUST COMPLETE </strong>- <i>Devil May Cry</i> meets <i>Ace Combat</i>. a high speed Acelike Roguelike with <strong><i>SSSTYLE</i></strong>. Cut across cel-shaded, action-packed, arcade-paced dogfights as you fly, fight, and upgrade your roster of kickass planes. Every battle is massive, every location is procedural, and every fight is a spectacle - whether it's aircraft, blimps, dragons or mechs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Be <strong>STYLISH</strong>, be a SPECTACLE, be an ACE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639060/extras/cedf4a914164a2245258090b6d1314ac.poster.avif?t=1787515432\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639060/extras/cedf4a914164a2245258090b6d1314ac.webm?t=1787515432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639060/extras/cedf4a914164a2245258090b6d1314ac.mp4?t=1787515432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weave, destroy, dodge, and parry everything that comes your way. Earn style points and <strong>enhance your style ranking</strong> by flying like a true ace. The stage is all yours, show the enemy your moves!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A DIFFERENT SKY EACH TIME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639060/extras/0f38abdb7bae6b12a08a330002581422.poster.avif?t=1787515432\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639060/extras/0f38abdb7bae6b12a08a330002581422.webm?t=1787515432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639060/extras/0f38abdb7bae6b12a08a330002581422.mp4?t=1787515432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every map is <strong>procedurally generated</strong> and no two fights are alike: <strong>Weather changes, cloud cover variation, terrain anomalies</strong>, and random map events among <strong>4 distinct environmental zones</strong> change the battlefield each time you play.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BURN THROUGH THE SKIES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639060/extras/58c52987fbb2b3963c3e4fd02c3100f7.poster.avif?t=1787515432\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639060/extras/58c52987fbb2b3963c3e4fd02c3100f7.webm?t=1787515432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639060/extras/58c52987fbb2b3963c3e4fd02c3100f7.mp4?t=1787515432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make sharp turns &amp; aggressive plays by <strong>Drifting</strong>, because angle of attack is just a suggestion to you. <strong>Boost</strong> forward and cut through clouds, leaving everything in the dust. No, it's not your plane. <strong>You are just built different.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMPLETE YOUR DELIVERY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You're the Courier.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Your mission? <strong>Deliver the package.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The destination? Right in the middle of an all-out warzone, where elite fighter squadrons from across the globe swarm the sky all united for the noble goal of glory and peace... <strong>with only you to get in their way, again and again and again.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crashing and burning is just a temporary inconvenience for you, however: Warp tech will pull you back. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > No matter how far you fly, no matter how long it takes, no matter how many elite pilots they send after you, nothing will stop you from finishing your goal. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DELIVERY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MUST</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COMPLETE.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>(Hopefully before it gets cold!)</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DELIVERY MUST COMPLETE </strong>- <i>Devil May Cry</i> meets <i>Ace Combat</i>. a high speed Acelike Roguelike with <strong><i>SSSTYLE</i></strong>. Cut across cel-shaded, action-packed, arcade-paced dogfights as you fly, fight, and upgrade your roster of kickass planes. Every battle is massive, every location is procedural, and every fight is a spectacle - whether it's aircraft, blimps, dragons or mechs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Be <strong>STYLISH</strong>, be a SPECTACLE, be an ACE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639060/extras/cedf4a914164a2245258090b6d1314ac.poster.avif?t=1787515432\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639060/extras/cedf4a914164a2245258090b6d1314ac.webm?t=1787515432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639060/extras/cedf4a914164a2245258090b6d1314ac.mp4?t=1787515432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weave, destroy, dodge, and parry everything that comes your way. Earn style points and <strong>enhance your style ranking</strong> by flying like a true ace. The stage is all yours, show the enemy your moves!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A DIFFERENT SKY EACH TIME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639060/extras/0f38abdb7bae6b12a08a330002581422.poster.avif?t=1787515432\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639060/extras/0f38abdb7bae6b12a08a330002581422.webm?t=1787515432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639060/extras/0f38abdb7bae6b12a08a330002581422.mp4?t=1787515432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every map is <strong>procedurally generated</strong> and no two fights are alike: <strong>Weather changes, cloud cover variation, terrain anomalies</strong>, and random map events among <strong>4 distinct environmental zones</strong> change the battlefield each time you play.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BURN THROUGH THE SKIES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639060/extras/58c52987fbb2b3963c3e4fd02c3100f7.poster.avif?t=1787515432\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639060/extras/58c52987fbb2b3963c3e4fd02c3100f7.webm?t=1787515432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639060/extras/58c52987fbb2b3963c3e4fd02c3100f7.mp4?t=1787515432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make sharp turns &amp; aggressive plays by <strong>Drifting</strong>, because angle of attack is just a suggestion to you. <strong>Boost</strong> forward and cut through clouds, leaving everything in the dust. No, it's not your plane. <strong>You are just built different.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMPLETE YOUR DELIVERY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You're the Courier.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Your mission? <strong>Deliver the package.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The destination? Right in the middle of an all-out warzone, where elite fighter squadrons from across the globe swarm the sky all united for the noble goal of glory and peace... <strong>with only you to get in their way, again and again and again.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crashing and burning is just a temporary inconvenience for you, however: Warp tech will pull you back. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > No matter how far you fly, no matter how long it takes, no matter how many elite pilots they send after you, nothing will stop you from finishing your goal. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DELIVERY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MUST</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COMPLETE.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>(Hopefully before it gets cold!)</strong></p>", "short_description": "High speed Acelike Roguelike with SSSTYLE. Cut across cel-shaded, action-packed, arcade-paced dogfights as you fly, fight, and upgrade your roster of kickass planes. Every battle is massive, every location is procedural, and every fight is a spectacle- whether it's aircraft, blimps, dragons or mechs", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639060/5b16511cfeb59091a14a5882559e3cf2068bbc82/header.jpg?t=1787515432", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/s